{"id":"38dd011a65e9bf42","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-adelic-automorphic.md","title":"Adelic Automorphic Form","display":"df-adelic-automorphic — Adelic Automorphic Form","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-adelic-automorphic","aliases":["58-df-adelic-automorphic","Adelic Automorphic Form"],"display":"df-adelic-automorphic — Adelic Automorphic Form","depends_on":["[[58-df-automorphic-form]]","[[58-df-adelic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-adelic-automorphic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-adelic-automorphic</span><span>Adelic Automorphic Form</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-adelic-automorphic — Adelic Automorphic Form"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9f19ee9b463a0acf\" href=\"?note=9f19ee9b463a0acf\" title=\"58-df-automorphic-form\">58-df-automorphic-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4095490ed42eb546\" href=\"?note=4095490ed42eb546\" title=\"58-df-adelic\">58-df-adelic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{A}_K\">\\(\\mathbb{A}_K\\)</span> (adelic ring of number field <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (reductive group over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathbb{C}^{G(\\mathbb{A}_K)}\">\\(f\\in\\mathbb{C}^{G(\\mathbb{A}_K)}\\)</span> (function on adelic points)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g \\in G(\\mathbb{A}_K)\">\\(g \\in G(\\mathbb{A}_K)\\)</span> (adelic group element)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma \\in G(K)\">\\(\\gamma \\in G(K)\\)</span> (rational point)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G(\\mathbb A_{K,f})\">\\(G(\\mathbb A_{K,f})\\)</span> (finite-adelic factor of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G(\\mathbb A_K)\">\\(G(\\mathbb A_K)\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_\\infty\\leq G(K\\otimes_{\\mathbb Q}\\mathbb R)\">\\(K_\\infty\\leq G(K\\otimes_{\\mathbb Q}\\mathbb R)\\)</span> (maximal compact subgroup)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak z_\\infty\">\\(\\mathfrak z_\\infty\\)</span> (center of the complexified universal enveloping algebra)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R(h)f:g\\mapsto f(gh)\">\\(R(h)f:g\\mapsto f(gh)\\)</span> (right-translation action)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"dR(z)f\">\\(dR(z)f\\)</span> (the derived right action of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\mathfrak z_\\infty\">\\(z\\in\\mathfrak z_\\infty\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CompactOpen}(K_f)\">\\(\\operatorname{CompactOpen}(K_f)\\)</span> (compact-open subgroup predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Smooth}_\\infty(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{Smooth}_\\infty(f)\\)</span> (smoothness in the archimedean variables)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ModerateGrowth}(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{ModerateGrowth}(f)\\)</span> (uniform moderate-growth predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdelicAutomorphic}_{G,K}\">\\(\\mathrm{AdelicAutomorphic}_{G,K}\\)</span> (adelic automorphic-form predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adelic\\text{-}automorphic} \\vdash \\mathrm{AdelicAutomorphic}_{G,K}(f) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; f\\in\\mathbb C^{G(\\mathbb A_K)} \\land \\forall\\gamma\\in G(K)\\;\\forall g\\in G(\\mathbb A_K)\\;(f(\\gamma g)=f(g)) \\land \\operatorname{Smooth}_\\infty(f) \\land \\exists K_f\\leq G(\\mathbb A_{K,f})\\;(\\operatorname{CompactOpen}(K_f)\\land\\forall k\\in K_f\\;R(k)f=f) \\land \\dim_{\\mathbb C}\\operatorname{span}\\{R(k)f:k\\in K_\\infty\\}&lt;\\omega \\land \\dim_{\\mathbb C}\\operatorname{span}\\{dR(z)f:z\\in\\mathfrak z_\\infty\\}&lt;\\omega \\land \\operatorname{ModerateGrowth}(f)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adelic\\text{-}automorphic} \\vdash \\mathrm{AdelicAutomorphic}_{G,K}(f) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; f\\in\\mathbb C^{G(\\mathbb A_K)} \\land \\forall\\gamma\\in G(K)\\;\\forall g\\in G(\\mathbb A_K)\\;(f(\\gamma g)=f(g)) \\land \\operatorname{Smooth}_\\infty(f) \\land \\exists K_f\\leq G(\\mathbb A_{K,f})\\;(\\operatorname{CompactOpen}(K_f)\\land\\forall k\\in K_f\\;R(k)f=f) \\land \\dim_{\\mathbb C}\\operatorname{span}\\{R(k)f:k\\in K_\\infty\\}&lt;\\omega \\land \\dim_{\\mathbb C}\\operatorname{span}\\{dR(z)f:z\\in\\mathfrak z_\\infty\\}&lt;\\omega \\land \\operatorname{ModerateGrowth}(f)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The definition combines left <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G(K)\">\\(G(K)\\)</span>-invariance, archimedean smoothness, finite-level invariance, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_\\infty\">\\(K_\\infty\\)</span>-finiteness, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak z_\\infty\">\\(\\mathfrak z_\\infty\\)</span>-finiteness under the derived action <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"dR\">\\(dR\\)</span>, and moderate growth.</li>\n<li>Cuspidality, a central character, Whittaker expansions, and Rankin--Selberg integrals are additional conditions or constructions, not consequences of adelic automorphy alone.</li>\n<li>An unramified local component is fixed by a hyperspecial maximal compact subgroup at the corresponding non-archimedean place.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Bump, Automorphic Forms and Representations</li>\n<li>Gelbart, Automorphic Forms on Adele Groups</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-automorphic-form","status":"resolved","id":"9f19ee9b463a0acf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-automorphic-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-adelic","status":"resolved","id":"4095490ed42eb546","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-adelic]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb{A}_K","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathbb{C}^{G(\\mathbb{A}_K)}","display":false},{"tex":"g \\in G(\\mathbb{A}_K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\gamma \\in G(K)","display":false},{"tex":"G(\\mathbb A_{K,f})","display":false},{"tex":"G(\\mathbb A_K)","display":false},{"tex":"K_\\infty\\leq G(K\\otimes_{\\mathbb Q}\\mathbb R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak z_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"R(h)f:g\\mapsto f(gh)","display":false},{"tex":"dR(z)f","display":false},{"tex":"z\\in\\mathfrak z_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CompactOpen}(K_f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Smooth}_\\infty(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ModerateGrowth}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AdelicAutomorphic}_{G,K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}adelic\\text{-}automorphic} \\vdash \\mathrm{AdelicAutomorphic}_{G,K}(f) \\;\\leftrightarrow\\; f\\in\\mathbb C^{G(\\mathbb A_K)} \\land \\forall\\gamma\\in G(K)\\;\\forall g\\in G(\\mathbb A_K)\\;(f(\\gamma g)=f(g)) \\land \\operatorname{Smooth}_\\infty(f) \\land \\exists K_f\\leq G(\\mathbb A_{K,f})\\;(\\operatorname{CompactOpen}(K_f)\\land\\forall k\\in K_f\\;R(k)f=f) \\land \\dim_{\\mathbb C}\\operatorname{span}\\{R(k)f:k\\in K_\\infty\\}<\\omega \\land \\dim_{\\mathbb C}\\operatorname{span}\\{dR(z)f:z\\in\\mathfrak z_\\infty\\}<\\omega \\land \\operatorname{ModerateGrowth}(f)","display":true},{"tex":"G(K)","display":false},{"tex":"K_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak z_\\infty","display":false},{"tex":"dR","display":false}],"bytes":2480,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-adelic-automorphic.md|58-df-adelic-automorphic]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["9f19ee9b463a0acf","4095490ed42eb546"]}